cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this archive, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "KUSAK-INFRA: C++20 Order Execution Engine and Pre-Registered Retail Crypto Signal Research Archive"
abstract: >-
  Archived C++20 / Linux x86-64 single-symbol order execution engine for
  Binance Spot and USD-M Futures (lock-free SPSC rings, table-driven order
  state machine, fail-closed order firewall, kill switch, startup
  reconciliation), together with pre-registered signal research records.
  240 pre-registered hypothesis cells documented in this repository yielded
  0 net-positive candidates after retail Binance VIP 0 costs. Three P0 safety
  findings remain open; the engine was never traded with real capital.
